  "generated_by": "tests/fixtures/build-handover-fixtures.mjs",
  "note": "Generated by running the real backend on a disposable database. Regenerate after any contract change; the diff IS the change. Ids and timestamps are replaced with stable placeholders, and every capability token and hash is masked, so two runs produce identical files and no working credential is committed. No live database was touched. No provider was configured beyond a NAME IN SETTINGS, no message was sent, no file was signed and no money moved. The settlement model in the payment scenario is a LABELLED DOUBLE this script created and dropped; the system has none. No real customer, address, phone number or supplier product appears here.",
